-- Source module: Solutions.KIL4Env
/-!
# KIL4: pushing computed parameters

* `Ex.congrG`: evaluation, side conditions, bounds and cost of an expression only depend on the
  stacks it reads.
* `pushes l` pushes the values of the expressions of `l` (each reading only stacks not pushed by
  `l`), `pops l` pops; `Sp.pushes`, `Sp.pops`.
* `powE`, `prodE`: products of parameters; `stgPush`: the pushes of the table stages
  (radix, control, suffix volume, radix·suffix volume), `stgPush_sp`: they establish `StgOK`.
